---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="About Kirk Keel — Senior Well Control Specialist & Energy AI Architect"
  description="25+ years in well operations management, drilling, completions, and well interventions (CWI). Senior Well Control Specialist at Boots & Coots, Certified Well Control Instructor, and builder of deterministic Energy AI systems."
>

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-6">
    <!-- Status & Credentials Pill -->
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-950/70 border border-cyan-800/80 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 animate-pulse"></span>
        Senior Well Control Specialist · Boots & Coots
      </div>
      <span class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-900 bg-emerald-950/40 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full">Certified Well Control Instructor</span>
      <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">Houston, TX</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Header -->
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
      Kirk Keel
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-lg sm:text-xl text-cyan-400 font-medium">
      Senior Well Control Specialist | Operations Management & Energy AI Architecture
    </p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400 font-mono">
      25+ Years in Well Operations · Surface & Subsea BOPs · Active/Passive MPD · Deterministic Physics Guardrails
    </p>

    <!-- Executive Summary Card -->
    <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-slate-900/70 border border-slate-800 mt-8 relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute -right-20 -top-20 w-80 h-80 bg-cyan-500/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-400"></span>
        Operations Management & Engineering Background
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        With over 25 years in operations management across land and offshore environments, my career has centered on the execution and pressure control integrity of complex well operations—drilling, completions, and well interventions (CWI). I have managed high-pressure, critical well operations utilizing both surface and subsea BOP systems enhanced with active and passive Managed Pressure Drilling (MPD).
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mt-3">
        Currently serving as a <strong>Senior Well Control Specialist at Boots & Coots</strong> and a <strong>Certified Well Control Instructor</strong>, my operational focus is ensuring wellbore pressure integrity, regulatory adherence (API RP 53 / 59 / 16ST), and rigorous preparedness during complex formation kick events.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mt-3">
        Over the past several years, I have coupled that operational reality with software engineering. In my development lab, I design and build **deterministic Energy AI architectures**: pairing Large Language Models and local rig-edge SLMs with certified, zero-dependency physics calculation engines via the **Model Context Protocol (MCP)**. My production engines eliminate probabilistic hallucinations in well control calculations by strictly enforcing IADC WellSharp directional rounding and API RP 53 tolerances.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-slate-800/80 text-xs font-mono">
        <div>
          <div class="text-cyan-400 font-bold text-lg">25+ Yrs</div>
          <div class="text-slate-400">Well Operations Management</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-emerald-400 font-bold text-lg">2,731+</div>
          <div class="text-slate-400">Automated Physics Tests</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-purple-400 font-bold text-lg">14 Repos</div>
          <div class="text-slate-400">Production & Open-Source Software</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Core Operational & Technical Pillars -->
    <div class="mt-12 space-y-8 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400"></span>
          Operational Pillars & Domain Focus
        </h2>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800">
            <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-sm mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-cyan-400">01.</span> Well Operations & Pressure Control
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Drilling, completions, and well interventions (CWI) across land, offshore, and deepwater assets. Hands-on management of surface and subsea BOP stacks, choke manifolds, and well kill execution.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800">
            <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-sm mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-400">02.</span> Active & Passive MPD Systems
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Managed Pressure Drilling operations utilizing surface backpressure, continuous circulating systems, and rotating control devices (RCD) to navigate narrow drilling margins safely.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800">
            <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-sm mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-purple-400">03.</span> Deterministic MCP Physics Engines
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Years of developing Model Context Protocol (MCP) tool servers that strictly gate AI reasoning with certified, deterministic calculations (KMW, MAASP, Step-Down schedules) backed by 2,731+ unit tests.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800">
            <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-sm mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-amber-400">04.</span> Air-Gapped Rig-Edge Telemetry & SLMs
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Real-time 1-second WITSML telemetry parsing, automated kick pit gain detection, and local Small Language Model (SLM) sidecars running on rig-floor hardware without internet or satellite dependence.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Certifications & Standards Matrix -->
      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400"></span>
          Certifications & Standards Compliance
        </h2>
        
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800 space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-1 border-b border-slate-800/80 pb-3">
            <span class="font-bold text-white">Well Control Instruction</span>
            <span class="text-cyan-400 font-mono">Certified Well Control Instructor</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-1 border-b border-slate-800/80 pb-3">
            <span class="font-bold text-white">IADC WellSharp</span>
            <span class="text-cyan-400 font-mono">Supervisor Level / Surface & Subsea Stacks</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-1 border-b border-slate-800/80 pb-3">
            <span class="font-bold text-white">Industry Standards Mastery</span>
            <span class="text-slate-300 font-mono">API RP 53 (BOP Systems), API RP 59 (Well Control), API Spec 16A/D, API RP 16ST</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-1">
            <span class="font-bold text-white">Specialized Hydraulics & Modeling</span>
            <span class="text-slate-300 font-mono">Active/Passive MPD Hydraulics, Zuber-Findlay Drift-Flux, Real-Gas (PV=ZnRT) Non-Linearity</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Technology & Architecture Stack -->
      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400"></span>
          Software & AI Architecture Stack
        </h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-cyan-400 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Systems & Physics</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Python (FastAPI, NumPy, SciPy, Pydantic), C++, Rust, WebSocket telemetry streams, transient ODE solvers, Docker microservices.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">AI, Rig Edge & MLOps</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Model Context Protocol (MCP), LiteLLM multi-model routing, local Ollama / SLMs, OpenTelemetry distributed tracing, CI/CD evaluation gates.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-purple-400 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Frontend & Interfaces</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">TypeScript, Astro v7, Tailwind CSS, React, Three.js 3D trajectory rendering, dynamic SVG telemetry plotting, reactive single-page apps.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Contact / Engagement Card -->
      <section class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-900 via-slate-900 to-cyan-950/40 border border-slate-800 mt-12">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Connect & Collaborate</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 mt-1 max-w-xl">
              Interested in technical discussions around well control integrity, managed pressure drilling, deterministic physics modeling, and rig-edge AI systems.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 mt-4 text-xs font-mono">
              <a href="mailto:kirk.david.keel@gmail.com" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-cyan-500 hover:bg-cyan-400 text-slate-950 font-bold transition-colors">
                kirk.david.keel@gmail.com ✉
              </a>
              <a href="https://github.com/Greybeard00007" target="_blank" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-200 border border-slate-700 transition-colors">
                GitHub (@Greybeard00007) ↗
              </a>
              <a href="https://kcklayton.com" target="_blank" class="text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-300 py-2">
                kcklayton.com ↗
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>

</BaseLayout>
